{"id": "19-2144-2-8", "zh": "5,11. namo 之后加 assa", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2145-2-8", "zh": "在 namo 一词之后，表“作（礼敬）”这一意义时，加 assa 词缀。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2145-9-22", "zh": "在“作礼敬”这一意义上加 assa 词缀后，再加 ti 等人称词尾，如 tathāgataṃ namassati（礼敬如来）、namassanti 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2146-2-7", "zh": "5,12. 名词之后表动词根义时加 i", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2147-2-8", "zh": "名词之后，表动词根的意义时，通常加 i 词缀。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2147-9-19", "zh": "“以大象越过”：加 i 词缀，删去插入词缀，变为 e 音，再以 ay 替换，得 atihatthayati。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2147-20-40", "zh": "同样，“伴着琵琶歌唱”为 upavīṇāyati；“使律牢固”为 daḷhayati；“夜晚清净”为 visuddhāyati；“问候安好”为 kusalāyati，等等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2148-2-8", "zh": "5,13. sacca 等之后加 āpi", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2149-2-7", "zh": "sacca 等词之后，表动词根的意义时，加 āpi 词缀。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2149-8-29", "zh": "“宣说真实”：加 āpi 及 ti 等词尾后，依“ṇi、ṇāpi 等之后可选”这条规则，删去插入词缀，并变为 e 音、以 ay 替换。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2149-30-34", "zh": "得 saccāpayati、saccāpeti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2149-35-39", "zh": "“宣说意义”为 atthāpayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2149-40-42", "zh": "同样有 vedāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2149-43-48", "zh": "“使干燥”为 sukkhāpayati、sukkhāpeti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2150-2-8", "zh": "5,16. 表使役者的行为时，也加 ṇi、ṇāpi", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2151-2-14", "zh": "谁驱使施事者，表示这个人的行为时，动词根之后通常加 ṇi、ṇāpi 词缀。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2152-2-10", "zh": "u、ū 结尾的词根加 ṇi 词缀，ā 结尾的词根在这里只加 ṇāpi；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2153-2-11", "zh": "其余词根两者都可加，或只加其中一个，这是由于承接了“通常”（bahulaṃ）一词。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-2154-2-9", "zh": "不及物动词加上 ṇi、ṇāpi 之后，也就成为及物动词；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2155-2-10", "zh": "及物动词成为双宾语动词，双宾语动词则成为三宾语动词。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2156-2-12", "zh": "因此，ṇi、ṇāpi 可用于主动语态和被动语态；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2157-2-10", "zh": "但不用于无人称语态；在使役句中，原来的施事者成为宾语。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2158-2-7", "zh": "它在 nī 等动词中是主要宾语，在 duh 等动词中是次要宾语；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-2159-2-11", "zh": "加 ṇi、ṇāpi 时，原来的施事者是动词所表述的宾语。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-2160-2-7", "zh": "在“使成为”这一意义上，依本条加 ṇi 词缀。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2160-8-10", "zh": "ṇ 音的作用是执行 ṇ 附标所规定的变化。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2160-11-34", "zh": "依“i 类、u 类元音在词缀前变为 e、o”这条规则变为 o 音，再依“带 ṇ 附标时变为 āy、āv”这条规则，在带 ṇ 附标时以 āv 替换。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2160-35-59", "zh": "加 ti 等词尾时，依“ṇi、ṇāpi、āpi 之后可选”这条规则删去插入词缀，变为 e 音后，依“e、o 在元音前变为 ay、av”这条规则以 ay 替换。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2160-60-70", "zh": "他修习定：bhāvayati、bhāveti，bhāvayanti、bhāventi 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2160-71-76", "zh": "被动语态：定被他修习，bhāvīyati 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2160-77-88", "zh": "这里依“元音变长”这条规则，在被动词缀 ya 前 i 音变长。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2160-89-96", "zh": "bhāvayissati、bhāvessati，bhāvayissanti、bhāvessanti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2160-97-108", "zh": "不定过去时中，ī 变为 si 时有 abhāvesi、bhāvesi；又有 abhāvayi、bhāvayi，abhāvayiṃsu、bhāvayiṃsu。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2160-109-119", "zh": "删去后一个元音时，有 abhāvesuṃ、bhāvesuṃ，abhāvayaṃsu、bhāvayaṃsu，abhāvayuṃ、bhāvayuṃ 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2160-120-123", "zh": "被动语态：abhāvīyi、bhāvīyi 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2160-124-129", "zh": "abhāvissa、abhāvayissa，abhāvissaṃsu、abhāvayissaṃsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2160-130-132", "zh": "被动语态：abhāvayissaṃ 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2160-133-136", "zh": "bhāve、bhāveyya 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2160-137-139", "zh": "被动语态：bhāvīyeyya 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2160-140-143", "zh": "bhāvayatu、bhāvetu 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2160-144-146", "zh": "被动语态：bhāvīyatu 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2161-2-9", "zh": "在“使煮”这一意义上，加 ṇi、ṇāpi 词缀。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2161-10-22", "zh": "他让提婆达多煮饭：pācayati、pāceti 等；同样也有 pācāpayati、pācāpeti 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2161-23-34", "zh": "被动语态：饭由他让提婆达多煮，pācīyati、pācāpīyati 等；将来时等其他时态也应照此类推。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2162-2-15", "zh": "在“使去”这一意义上：他让那个人到村子去，gamayati、gameti、gacchāpayati、gacchāpeti 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2162-16-23", "zh": "被动语态：那个人被他遣往村子，gamīyati、gacchāpīyati 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2163-2-17", "zh": "guh（覆藏义）：在“使覆藏”的意义上加 ṇi 时，依“guh 在元音前”这条规则变为长音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2163-18-22", "zh": "gūhayati、gūhayanti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2164-2-23", "zh": "dis、dus（不喜义）：在“使不喜”的意义上加 ṇi 时，依“ṇi 前 dus 变为长音”这条规则变长，得 dūsayati 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2165-2-10", "zh": "同样，“使人欲求”为 icchāpayati、icchāpeti，esayati、eseti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2165-11-15", "zh": "“使人约束”为 niyamayati、niyameti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2165-16-23", "zh": "同样有 āsayati、āseti，acchāpayati、acchāpeti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2165-24-33", "zh": "lābhayati、lābheti；同样有 vāsayati、vāseti，vāsāpayati、vāsāpeti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2165-34-41", "zh": "vāhayati、vāheti，vāhāpayati、vāhāpeti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2165-42-49", "zh": "同样有 jīrayati、mārayati、dassayati 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2165-50-59", "zh": "hū（存在义）：“使人能够”为 pahāvayati、pahāveti 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2165-60-63", "zh": "sāyayati、sāyāpayati、sāyāpeti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2165-64-66", "zh": "nāyāpayati、nāyāpeti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2165-67-69", "zh": "patiṭṭhāpayati、patiṭṭhāpeti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2165-70-72", "zh": "变为短音时为 patiṭṭhapeti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2165-73-90", "zh": "在“使杀”的意义上加 ṇi、ṇāpi，依“带 ṇ 附标时 han 变为 ghāta”这条规则替换为 ghāta，得 ghātayati、ghāteti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2165-91-97", "zh": "同样有 juhāvayati、juhāveti，jahāpayati、jahāpeti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2165-98-100", "zh": "hāpayati、hāpeti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2165-101-103", "zh": "dāpayati、dāpeti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2165-104-113", "zh": "vidhāpayati、vidhāpeti，pidahāpayati、pidahāpeti。（以上是 bhū 等类动词的规则。）", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2166-2-6", "zh": "现在展示 rudh 等八类动词：rodhayati、rodheti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2166-7-9", "zh": "devayati、deveti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2166-10-12", "zh": "todayati、todeti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2166-13-15", "zh": "jayāpayati、jayāpeti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2166-16-18", "zh": "vikkayati、vikkayāpeti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2166-19-21", "zh": "sāvayati、sāveti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2166-22-24", "zh": "vitānayati、vitāneti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2166-25-28", "zh": "corāpayati、corāpeti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2167-2-10", "zh": "以 kha 等词缀结尾的词干之后，也加 ṇi、ṇāpi；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2168-2-10", "zh": "这里所见的许多带 ṇi、ṇāpi 的形式，就是证明。", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "19-2169-2-11", "zh": "“使人忍耐”为 titikkheti、titikkhāpeti；又有 tikicchayati、tikiccheti、tikicchāpayati、tikicchāpeti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2169-12-15", "zh": "同样有 bubhukkheti、bubhukkhāpeti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2169-16-17", "zh": "pabbatāyayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2169-18-24", "zh": "puttīyayati 等。（以上是 kha 等词缀的规则。）", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2170-2-6", "zh": "《用法成就》（Payogasiddhi）第六篇 ti 等词尾篇至此结束。", "confidence": 75}
